{"steam_appid":4286550,"steam_name":"Keep on Mining! - Worlds","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4286550/1975941822/0df6c97ded3574b833df8e8f72dd82948fcc684d/1770926124/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770926756","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257285865/61e04a877add5a3419efbfb03321e1595c2d77cd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770926756","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/d8f0aa9ac87a388d3ce7c8d76139daed581ff3e3/ss_d8f0aa9ac87a388d3ce7c8d76139daed581ff3e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778249630","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/96075160b82925334a3f5c24e3b4143f4dfe6ef9/ss_96075160b82925334a3f5c24e3b4143f4dfe6ef9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778249630","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/a6bac87740c2f9a218ab9c07b168046a0daf3f2e/ss_a6bac87740c2f9a218ab9c07b168046a0daf3f2e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778249630","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/07fa7d41536a71e01432329f0a21b4a6d8ff3a74/ss_07fa7d41536a71e01432329f0a21b4a6d8ff3a74.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778249630","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/025764e87da4f741b82acab5066a9e0b9c743108/ss_025764e87da4f741b82acab5066a9e0b9c743108.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778249630"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/d6494aa09630c4735d654ffec95c576c.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep on Mining! - Worlds is a simple incremental mining game about mining rocks. The sequel keeps the core gameplay loop from <i>Keep on Mining!</i> but adds many more worlds, upgrades, artifacts, pickaxes and some cool new stuff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/788cd7a14c96cd7aab9437f03896d4c5.poster.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/788cd7a14c96cd7aab9437f03896d4c5.webm?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/788cd7a14c96cd7aab9437f03896d4c5.mp4?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/4f60f8b26702a26f530baec239f93ac8.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress in KOM - Worlds, your ability to mine rocks reaches chaotic levels of destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/8bf7d31a169409de752ec92c79a89a49.poster.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/8bf7d31a169409de752ec92c79a89a49.webm?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/8bf7d31a169409de752ec92c79a89a49.mp4?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/9be74434e7683cae09abb371e8ba6787.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make progress though the game via unlocking new worlds! Worlds can be purchased using your talent points. Talent point are gathered via leveling up. Every time you purchase a new world, 5 talent cards will appear. Choose 2 to keep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/0d6bdfb1ccdd5eaba6e945f8c6fa2f75.poster.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/0d6bdfb1ccdd5eaba6e945f8c6fa2f75.webm?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/0d6bdfb1ccdd5eaba6e945f8c6fa2f75.mp4?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/6d0c427d1790b1e69236a695abab2236.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Purchase permanent upgrades inside the Skill Tree! The Skill tree features 200+ upgrades and has a variety of fun upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/ed2968b97abf89957a233c44fbac56d7.poster.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/ed2968b97abf89957a233c44fbac56d7.webm?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/ed2968b97abf89957a233c44fbac56d7.mp4?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/dd4f2ccee91e112b5fa7971431660583.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your gathered bars to craft new pickaxes. Pickaxes can also be upgraded with your gems! Upgrading your pickaxe will improve every pickaxe stat. Every pickaxe also has a unique Equip Bonus that will only apply to the equipped pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/7f082bdb23fb3bd445390953b1c0a237.poster.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/7f082bdb23fb3bd445390953b1c0a237.webm?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/7f082bdb23fb3bd445390953b1c0a237.mp4?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/1282fbf619d6ab37b75eb0e91d07825a.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can purchase items in the shop. Items can be used before a mining session and their buffs lasts for 1 entire mining session. Just like the pickaxes, Items can be upgraded with your collected gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/c86debb1de621a6cbe5d9c88bdba95ec.poster.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/c86debb1de621a6cbe5d9c88bdba95ec.webm?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/c86debb1de621a6cbe5d9c88bdba95ec.mp4?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/bf885f18424518d08abbc14e44ea22c0.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/562c24f869ea40488b5ef925351a9e61.poster.avif?t=1778249630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/562c24f869ea40488b5ef925351a9e61.webm?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286550/extras/562c24f869ea40488b5ef925351a9e61.mp4?t=1778249630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Yup<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yup</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie"],"developers":["EagleEye Games"],"publishers":["EagleEye Games"],"release_date":"30 Mar, 2026"}